{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to <i>Cats Visiting Fairy Tales</i>,</strong> a cozy clicker game where curious cats explore the enchanting realms of fantasy!<br>From magical schools and ancient spellbound towns to hidden elf villages, each of the five hand-drawn levels is bursting with charm, mystery, and\u2014of course\u2014cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission?<br>Find <strong>100 hidden cats</strong> in every level and uncover a <strong>unique special item</strong> hidden within each scene to complete your <strong>fairy tales collection</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With calming gameplay, delightful art, and a sprinkle of magic, <i>Cats Visiting Fairy Tale</i> is the perfect escape into a world where adventure and fluffiness meet.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659940?t=1744718936","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659940/75f8e30aa09befe9813df1c7e1ab94158e756f34/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744718936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659940/586f6cc8ce54b04fead8b3687004dcf770c52cf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744718936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659940/586f6cc8ce54b04fead8b3687004dcf770c52cf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744718936","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to <i>Cats Visiting Fairy Tales</i>,</strong> a cozy clicker game where curious cats explore the enchanting realms of fantasy!<br>From magical schools and ancient spellboun